// Global, conditional (crates/velt_loader/src/globals): the trigonometric functions of `Math`,
// `sin`, `cos` and `tan` (velt/lang/math/trig_functions), for a program that calls one; other
// programs don't load the ports behind them, and a program that calls one loads no other group's.
// load when std/prelude/math uses: .sin .cos .tan
import "velt/lang/math/trig_functions";
